THON: '1'\n    HYDRACACHE_REQUIRE_REDIS_CLIENT_NODE: '1'\n    HYDRACACHE_REQUIRE_REDIS_CLIENT_GO: '1'\n    HYDRACACHE_REQUIRE_REDIS_CLIENT_JVM: '1'\n  run: cargo test -p hydracache-redis-compat --test redis_clients --locked -- --ignored --nocapture\n- name: Redis resource smoke\n  env:\n    HYDRACACHE_RUN_REDIS_COMPAT_RESOURCE_SMOKE: '1'\n  run: cargo test -p hydracache-redis-compat --test resp_resource_smoke --locked -- --ignored --nocapture\n"
