            "ok": true,
            "text": "name: Documentation Site\non:\n  push:\n    branches:\n    - main\n    paths:\n    - README.md\n    - docs-site/**\n    - docs/releases/**\n    - docs/performance/memory-*.md\n    - scripts/docs-*.mjs\n    - .github/workflows/docs-site.yml\n  pull_request:\n    paths:\n    - README.md\n    - docs-site/**\n    - docs/releases/**\n    - docs/performance/memory-*.md\n    - scripts/docs-*.mjs\n    - .github/workflows/docs-site.yml\n  workflow_dispatch: null\npermissions:\n  contents: read\n  pages: write\n  id-token: write\nconcurrency:\n  group: docs-site-${{ github.ref }}\n  cancel-in-progress: true\njobs:\n  build:\n    name: Build and verify docs\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    timeout-minutes: 30\n    steps:\n    - name: Checkout\n      uses: actions/checkout@v5\n    - name: Install Rust\n      uses: dtolnay/rust-toolchain@stable\n      with:\n        components: rustfmt\n    - name: Install Node\n      uses: actions/setup-node@v5\n      with:\n        node-version: 22\n        cache: npm\n        cache-dependency-path: console/package-lock.json\n    - name: Cache Rust dependencies\n      uses: Swatinem/rust-cache@v2\n      with:\n        prefix-key: v1-docs-site\n        cache-targets: true\n    - name: Install mdBook\n      uses: taiki-e/install-action@v2\n      with:\n        tool: mdbook@0.5.2\n    - name: Check docs examples formatting\n      run: cargo fmt --manifest-path docs-site/examples/Cargo.toml --check\n    - name: Check docs examples\n      run: cargo check --manifest-path docs-site/examples/Cargo.toml --all-targets --locked\n    - name: Build docs site\n      run: mdbook build docs-site\n    - name: Check documentation links\n      run: node scripts/docs-link-check.mjs\n    - name: Check release documentation synchronization\n      run: |\n        node --test scripts/docs-release-check.test.mjs\n        node scripts/docs-release-check.mjs\n    - name: Install browser dependencies\n      timeout-minutes: 10\n      run: |\n        npm --prefix console ci\n        npx --prefix console playwright install --with-deps chromium\n    - name: Run visual smoke\n      run: |\n        python3 -m http.server 3000 --directory docs-site/book &\n        node scripts/docs-visual-smoke.mjs\n    - name: Configure Pages\n      if: github.ref == 'refs/heads/main' && (github.event_name == 'push' || github.event_name == 'workflow_dispatch')\n      uses: actions/configure-pages@v6\n    - name: Upload Pages artifact\n      if: github.ref == 'refs/heads/main' && (github.event_name == 'push' || github.event_name == 'workflow_dispatch')\n      uses: actions/upload-pages-artifact@v5\n      with:\n        path: docs-site/book\n  deploy:\n    name: Publish docs\n    if: github.ref == 'refs/heads/main' && (github.event_name == 'push' || github.event_name == 'workflow_dispatch')\n    needs: build\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    timeout-minutes: 15\n    environment:\n      name: github-pages\n      url: ${{ steps.deployment.outputs.page_url }}\n    steps:\n    - name: Deploy to GitHub Pages\n      id: deployment\n      uses: actions/deploy-pages@v5\n"
